Z||000010||84fierotrevor||12-01-2001||11:45 PM||||don't buy a powerwhell's trust me !!<BR>we found one of those in the trash it was a big pink barbie corvvete. and it had no battery's<BR>bye the time we got to the bottom of the hill<BR>my friend had broken his right wrist and fractuerd his left.<BR>Security permenitly banned us from the Valley medical center hospital " it was there hill we where going down bye there emergency room" and the corvvete only had two wheel's left on it and the hood was missing. we didn't get fined though ! ha ha sucker's !<BR>I swear I don't recall that speed bump being there !<BR>I woulda seen that speed bump if the corvvete didn't shake so much from going like 35 on it's plastic wheel's!<BR>It like made everything sorta blurry and my eye's had started to water ohwell it was fun  as hell and I know how to roll ! to bad Josh didn't.<BR>||||reg||1
